      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SLIM NIKITA (2) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on his strong win the start prior, getting around this track over 643m in 37.79. Smart win two back and looks a key chance here. FEDERAL CASH (7) thrives over the longer races. Was fourth last time (22.11) over 380m at this track in a Grade 5 but is better suited by the longer journey. Has a good record here at this journey including two wins. Expected to give a good account. AMBER ANNIE (8) has a fair record and proved too classy last time to win by half a length at this track in a handy 22.02 beating Whitney Girl. Must be included in calculations. SCOTCH ROCKET (1) is building a solid run of minor placings and will play a big role again.",
